CONVERSATION RECORD STRUCTURE (verified)
-----------------------------------------
conversations collection schema:
  _id            - MongoDB document ID
  user           - userId of conversation owner (ObjectId string, matches users._id)
  conversationId - UUID string (used for message retrieval)
  title          - Auto-generated conversation title (first message summary)
  createdAt      - ISO 8601 timestamp
  updatedAt      - ISO 8601 timestamp
  endpoint       - AI endpoint used (e.g., "anthropic")
  model          - Model name (e.g., "claude-haiku-4-5")
  spec           - Preset used (e.g., "kids-assistant")
  messages       - Array of message _id references
  promptPrefix   - The system prompt active for this conversation

messages collection schema:
  messageId      - UUID
  conversationId - Matches conversations.conversationId
  user           - userId (same as conversation owner)
  text           - Full message text content
  sender         - "User" or "Claude"
  isCreatedByUser - true for child messages, false for AI responses
  createdAt      - ISO 8601 timestamp
  tokenCount     - Token count for this message

